Fixed full-width slot for the base map (WeekMapSection, map BaseMap.DESIGN_SIZE 1200 x 761, centred: 60 px cropped each side on a 1080 screen) so it does not scroll. %PilotRow and %Scroll stand under it (_place_under_map); with no map (hidden) they move up to this slot's top."
