[node name="Scroll" type="ScrollContainer" parent="SafeArea"]
unique_name_in_owner = true
editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류 — WeekProgressView.gd _list_scroll
Day card list under %PilotRow (top = %PilotRow bottom + 14, set by _place_under_map), bottom = the bar top − 14 (offset_bottom = −(128 + 14)). Grows to the RIGHT only: when the list overflows, the scroll bar adds its width outside the 1000 card column (as the code-built list did), so the cards stay put."
layout_mode = 1
anchors_preset = -1
